        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion AN-E5, St. Charles Lever and Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis lever features the fleur-de-lis along the outer edge, making this old-world looking door lever a must have for those who want to add a royal elegance to their home. The lever itself is designed with royal charm in mind, adding just the right amount of shape to an already interesting rosette.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for St. Charles Lever with St. Charles Rose Fusion AN-E5:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid Brass/Bronze Construction</li>\r\n<li>Cycle Tested to ANSI Standards</li>\r\n<li>\"Positive Stop\" lever spring mechanism</li>\r\n<li>Reversible Latchbolt in matching/coordinating finish</li>\r\n<li>Easy assembly with alignment block and rose posts</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Fleur-de-lis Door Lever Fusion AN-E5:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Projection: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: Either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass or Bronze</li>\r\n<li>Standard Latch Rotation is 40 Degrees.</li>\r\n<li>Square corner latches and strike plates </li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on one side of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on both sides of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "St. Charles Lever and Rose, Fusion AN-E5",
                "description": "St. Charles Lever with St. Charles Rose Fusion AN-E5 - This lever features the fleur-de-lis along the outer edge, making this old-world looking door lever a must have for those who want to add a royal elegance to their home. The lever itself is designed with royal charm in mind, adding just the right amount of shape to an already interesting rosette. Plus, it is available in Oil Rubbed Bronze and Medium Bronze finishes.",
